codex
`hard` and the first fixed-length escalation (`t=9`) were also solved 3/3. The harness is now testing `t=10` at the same 53-radius answer length; generation is slower here because the exact reference-cost conditioning is stronger, but this is the intended “grow the haystack, not the needle” axis.
