+
+The stored hinted-minus-placebo value `0.0` is only the zero-attempt sentinel; it is not an estimate, and no conclusion about hint responsiveness is justified. The structural hint names one invariant—residue classes modulo `t+4` stay intact—and gives no chained procedure. These arms are diagnostic and non-gating. G9(c), the actual cap gate, passes with the measurements above.
+
+## Use
+
+```python
+import json
