+| 1 | medium: `k=45,t=8,min=15,000` | 1681803361, 695006671, 853837756 | 3/3 solved | all witnesses verified |
+| 2 | hard: `k=53,t=8,min=40,000` | 1317078567, 1387726442, 2100883112 | 3/3 solved | all witnesses verified |
