The generator is complete and all local gates pass, but the oracle pool solved 21/21 bare instances across seven levels. `harden.py` returned `budget_bound`; therefore hardness was not established. Per the harness instructions, I did not create `REJECTED.md`.

Deliverables:

- [gen_2003_09314.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2003.09314/gen_2003_09314.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2003.09314/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2003.09314/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2003.09314/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [.meta.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2003.09314/.meta.json)
